{{!-- WHO A THREAD IS, at the head of their lane: one body for both layouts of the board (the column
      heads read down, the row heads read across), so the two cannot drift. ONE box around the
      portrait and the words, so the words centre on the portrait in both: the swimlanes pin their
      head's children one by one, and two pinned separately would line up by their tops. A player
      reads their playbook under their name ("The Seeker"). --}}
<span class="stonetop-timeline-lane-who">
	{{#if portrait}}
	<img class="stonetop-timeline-lane-portrait" src="{{this.portrait}}" alt="" draggable="false">
	{{/if}}
	<span class="stonetop-timeline-lane-label">
		<span class="stonetop-timeline-lane-name">{{this.name}}</span>
		{{#if playbook}}<span class="stonetop-timeline-lane-playbook">{{this.playbook}}</span>{{/if}}
	</span>
</span>
